    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c07434a1a5ad29bba785fcb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是一场令所有人都为止狂热的激斗。\r\n无人不为赛场上这二人的再战而欢呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab787712e9e296dc7b986efbb51164ea9c3c931ce8c2bee14d2c4606224359e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
