    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:040c634fbb9be643d2837661",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是本应夭折的故事的续篇。\r\n而这伟大故事的初章，胜者是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "90e8f10c379ed7b4af379e9d915bfee8f6eb3c36f7ecb80dda08bbd1c4b4a1cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105320.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99bcdc21a980d22517a7a931",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“保持这样”可不行哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca42c66ceb5d77af0d1fb3ad847ffe0ba36d4e53f22c58fc160c5ed315386527",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
