      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经不必再担心未来了。\r\n我们已经彻底挥别其他宇宙的悲剧，\r\n不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dcfac9453f8ba1500adbd2ef0c8f5fd4ed6a6d6d886872d28904b41f54074f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
